{
  "version": "kanoe-sandbox-ext.10",
  "note": "Additive only. CR 66: AgAPI 1.2 (EU 213) ADOPTED the Keep (keep.put/list/use/delete/activity) — it runs on EU's own schemas (spec/v1/schemas/keep/keep.schema.json). 1.1 (EU 211) had adopted CR 60–62's six. No sandbox extension is left. CR 69: magellan.read_site — read a business's own public website (offers, partners, contacts, booking channels, each quoting its source; robots.txt first; never a booking platform) — a Kanoe extension for EU to formalize in 1.3. CR 72: subscriptions.find / cancel_plan / cancel — the subscription radar (Kanoe extensions; EU to formalize). CR 73: registry.countries / get / documents / obtain_plan / verify — the registry survey's wave 0 (EU 214's design; Kanoe extensions until EU formalizes them in 1.3; registry.obtain is OFF). EU 214's registry codes ride on existing codes as details.registry_code.",
